body:
@KvngMikey good catch on the migrate command. I reproduced the same failure.

Since the issue is preexisting I put the fix in #1212 to keep this PR focused. It switches the query to named parameters, the same way the crud methods do, and adds the first test for the command (will run in CI).

Merge order doesn't matter if these both go in the same release, but since this depends on a working script #1212 is the better first candidate.
